-- ============================================================================
-- v1414: Seed / sample data — Testing, Technical Debt & Cybersecurity registers (v1413) for the demo project
-- ============================================================================
-- Owner request 2026-11-11: sample data where it was missing, 10 records for each Testing, Technical Debt & Cybersecurity register,
-- for SEED334-PRJ-08 (fictional "Northbridge Bank" technology programme, Information Technology pack).
-- Same scenario as the v1374 Architecture samples: the Northbridge Bank technology programme replacing
-- two legacy cores, go-live 10–12 April 2027. Dated around today (11 Nov 2026): SIT cycle 1 is closing,
-- the first external penetration test has reported and UAT, performance and DR tests are planned for 2027.
-- Records: testing 10, tech_debt 10, sec_reqs 10, threats 10, vulns 10, pen_tests 10.
-- Vendor-neutral (rule 26), person fields are plain text. display_id is left blank so Admin ID
-- Generation assigns it (rule 16.2). Fixed hex-only ids …-4000-a031- … a036- (ranges checked free
-- before use). ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING, and nothing is inserted if the project is missing.
-- Calculated values are worked out with the same rules as the app. The final query counts the
-- records per register, so a skipped insert is visible.
-- Prerequisites: v1413. Idempotent.
-- ============================================================================

